import { urls } from "../../../../data";
<div id="navigation-tabs-overview">
  <component-banner-img/>

  <p>
    A navigation tab <em>looks</em> like a normal
    <a href=`${urls.components}/tabs`>tab</a> , but is actually a hyperlink to a
    new page. Therefore a set of navigation tabs behaves more like a simple
    navigational widget, rather than a dynamic user-interface control.
  </p>
  <p>
    If a full page load is required when switching between tabbed content (i.e.
    acting like a link), use navigation tabs instead of the dynamic
    <a href=`${urls.components}/tabs`>tabs</a> pattern.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <code>fake-tabs</code> class is deprecated and will be removed in the
    next major version of Skin. Use <code>navigation-tabs</code> instead.
  </p>
</div>
